# The image is built from Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, rustfmt.toml, crates/ and
# testfixtures/ only (see Dockerfile). Everything else stays out of the build
# context — above all build output, ledgers and key material, which must never
# be sent to the Docker daemon, let alone baked into a layer. `**/` matters:
# a bare pattern matches only at the context root, and crates/ is copied whole.
**/target/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
deploy/
config/
scripts/
**/*.bean
!testfixtures/*.bean
**/*.bean.lock
**/*.bean.journal
**/*.bean.journal.torn-*
**/*.key
**/*.secret
**/.env
**/data/
gl-node.config.json
